<title>USA: Moscom names David Mazzella president.</title>
<headline>Moscom names David Mazzella president.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSFORD, N.Y. 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moscom Corp said Wednesday David G. Mazzella has been named president and chief operating officer, effective February 25.</p>
<p>The company said Albert J. Montevecchio remains chairman and chief executive oficer, noting the position of chief operating officer has been newly established for Mazzella.</p>
<p>Previously, he was president and chief executive of NPC/Scotgroup. ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
